; use_precise_interpolation changes the rounding of interpolated numbers
; only: a transaction still balances within the largest tolerance its
; numbers imply, 0.05 USD here, where the smallest is 0.000005 USD.
option "use_precise_interpolation" "TRUE"

2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Assets:C

2020-01-02 * "Off by 0.03655 USD"
  Assets:A  10.12345 USD
  Assets:B  -3.1 USD
  Assets:C  -7.06 USD
